{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/101a3cd917796b6f60b5a0eb1559187b.poster.avif?t=1772383943\" width=1170 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/101a3cd917796b6f60b5a0eb1559187b.webm?t=1772383943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/101a3cd917796b6f60b5a0eb1559187b.mp4?t=1772383943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In <strong>Turnip Rush</strong>, the goal is simple : <strong>Grow as much turnips as you can\u00a0</strong>while handling all the <strong>chaos</strong>\u00a0around ? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turnip Rush is getting rid the board game, letting every player\u00a0<strong>play together at any time</strong> ! Execute machiavellian plans to anhilate your friends hopes and dreams or be a victim of one of those, choose your side ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/620b00b204e1db7d1e0eb1e28b5abffd.poster.avif?t=1772383943\" width=1170 height=554 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/620b00b204e1db7d1e0eb1e28b5abffd.webm?t=1772383943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/620b00b204e1db7d1e0eb1e28b5abffd.mp4?t=1772383943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames are the core of Party Games and we have plenty of those. They all have <strong>different gameplay</strong> and atmospheres to fullfill your competition needs in every possible aspect. Perfect for establishing pure dominance on others !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/6f8819f0c59ec5bc058d7d66cfc9766f.poster.avif?t=1772383943\" width=1118 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/6f8819f0c59ec5bc058d7d66cfc9766f.webm?t=1772383943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/6f8819f0c59ec5bc058d7d66cfc9766f.mp4?t=1772383943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To spice things up, after every Minigame, players are given items that helps them on the BATTLEFIELD (the garden). The better you are at minigames, the better the item will be. But that's not it : every round an event is randomly selected. It could rain, snow, have tornados or a vengefull statue, who knows... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many things forcing you to adapt what you are doing to what's happening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Be the golem you always dreamed of and succomb to the pleasure of being cooler than others ! You can unlock plenty of skins by playing ! Enjoy trying new looks by mixing them together (No one will judge your doubful tastes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/622a0b8c1df18c668979d94d5efd8288.poster.avif?t=1772383943\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/622a0b8c1df18c668979d94d5efd8288.webm?t=1772383943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/622a0b8c1df18c668979d94d5efd8288.mp4?t=1772383943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895500?t=1772383943","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895500?t=1772383943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/bdc26666d4563f6129695d57c184bc53dcffd65b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772383943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/bdc26666d4563f6129695d57c184bc53dcffd65b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772383943","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/101a3cd917796b6f60b5a0eb1559187b.poster.avif?t=1772383943\" width=1170 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/101a3cd917796b6f60b5a0eb1559187b.webm?t=1772383943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895500/extras/101a3cd917796b6f60b5a0eb1559187b.mp4?t=1772383943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In <strong>Turnip Rush</strong>, the goal is simple : <strong>Grow as much turnips as you can\u00a0</strong>while handling all the <strong>chaos</strong>\u00a0around ? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turnip Rush is getting rid the board game, letting every player\u00a0<stro